  "reference": "Luka 17",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malange ga mihayo yīngī na yīngī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla hangī a bahemba bakwe gīkī, “Ītadūlīkanile ī sha kwipamya shileke ū kūbiza ho; gwike ū munhū wa kūshenheleja alī mu kwihīga kūtaale no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkūmeelela ūlū kūtungīlījiwa ū mu nhingo yakwe iwe lya kūshela, ūūkaponejiwa mu nyanza shimu, kūtinda kūng'wenheleja kwipama nūūlū ūmò wa bado bado aba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we, ilang'hanagi; ūlū ng'wiyo ūkūhūba ng'hūgūlage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū akakūhūba ng'hangala mpungatī ū mu lūshikū, hama ūshisha ng'hangala mpungatī alikala ūkūshokeela kūkūwīla gīkī, ‘Nilekejage’; nekejage ng'hana!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya kūzunya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a batūng'wa būng'wīla ū Seeba gīkī, “Tongejage ū kūzunya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Seeba ūbawīla, “Ūlū ng'ūbiza na kūzunya gītī gwa kabīyū ka haladali, mushikile nūūlū kūgūwīla nkūyū gīt'ūyū gīkī, ‘Dubbūkaga wīnge a henaho ūje ūkihambe mu nyanza.’ Ng'hana gūkūng'wigwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basese batī na solobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī gīsī ng'hana, ūlū munhū alī na nsese, hūna ū nsese ng'wenūyo ūbiza wajaga kūlīma, nūūlū wachilūlaga mitugo; ūlū ūūkashoka a ha kaya, nani ū mu bing'we ūyo akūshikīla kūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Nzūgū wigashe aha ūlye?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, atūng'wīla dūhū gīkī, ‘Bebe itungage ūkangīlīje ū kūnibeeja beegeja tame ū nene ī shilīwa ūnitengele naboneke; ūlū nalamale nang'ho ūkwigasha ūlye?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akūnūmbīlīja ū nsese ng'wenūyo kūlwa kūshikīlīja īyo alagīlilwe kwīta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īlī nū kū bing'we, ūlū ng'ūlinda ng'ūmala ū kwīta pyī īyo mulagīlilwe, hayagi gīkī, ‘A bise tūtī na solobo yose yose, nguno tūlī basese dūhū; twabeejaga īyo ītwigeleelilwe kwībeeja!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banhū ikūmi kūpījiwa mbiji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho wabūūka kūja Yelusalemu ūbītīla nzīla ya mu lūbīmbī lo Samalia na Galilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washika mu chalo shilebe, ūmanhya na banhū ikūmi basaatile mbiji. Bīmīīla ka kūle, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna būng'hamukīla balīhaya, “Seeba Yesu, tūkūlīlagwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wababona ūbawīla gīkī, “Jagi mukiyooleche kū bagabīji.” Na ng'hana bandya ū kūja; alīyo aho bataalī mu nzīla, bahayimanīla bapīla ī mbiji! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wabo aho wabona wapīla, ūshoka alīnkumīlīja Mulungu n'ilaka lya higūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshikīla kūgwa mu magūlū ga ng'wa Yesu, winama ha sī ū būshū bokwe ūnūmba; nūwe walī Nsamalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūshosha ūhaya, “Batapīlile a bose ikūmi? Al'a bangī abo kenda balī halī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baleka ū kwilonga a ba kwiza kūnūmba ū Mulungu, ūlū at'ū ngeni ūyū dūhū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla, “Būūkaga ūje, ū kūzunya kwako kwakūpījaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwiza kwa būtemi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafalisayo bakamūja mhayo gw'ikanza lya kwiza kwa būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu. Nang'hwe ūbashokeja ūbawīla gīkī, “Ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu būtiza būkūloleelagwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batandya kwiwīla gīkī, ‘Būūb'aha;’ nūūlū gīkī, ‘Būūb'ūko;’ Nguno ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu būlī hamò ning'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hamò ning'we",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, mu bing'we",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla a bahemba gīkī, “Jikūshika shikū ja kwikūmva a bing'we kūlūbona nūūlū lūmò lwa shikū ja Ng'wana wa Munhū, alīyo mutūdūla ū kūlūbona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ūlū bandya kūmuwīla gīkī, ‘Lolagi ūko’, nūūlū gīkī, ‘Lolagi aha,’ yaya ū kūja, yaya nūūlū kūbakūūbīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mu lūshikū lo Ng'wana wa Munhū īkūbiza gīt'ūmo lūlabi lūkalabyaga ng'wilunde, kūfuma ipandī līmò; lwang'weka kūshisha ipandī līngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike shiigelile aluhiwe tame mu mihayo mingī na kūleng'wa nī shibyalīlwe īshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmo īkabizīla mu shikū ja ng'wa Noa, h'ūmo īkūbizīla nū mu shikū ja Ng'wana wa Munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo balyaga, bang'waga, batoolaga, na batoolagwa; kūshisha lūshikū ūlo Noa akingīla mu ngalaba. Ī lihūūma aho liza lyūbayagaja pye a bose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo yalī nū mu shikū ja ng'wa Lutu; balyaga, bang'waga, bagūlaga shikolo na kūjinja, balīmaga na bazengaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lwashika ū lūshikū ūlo Lutu akafuma ū mu Sodoma, bidīkīlwa moto na būgota bo shibiliti, gītī kūtūlwa mbula kūfuma ng'wilunde, būshila pye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īkūbizīla nū mu lūshikū lo kwilonga kwa Ng'wana wa Munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ūyo ūsangwa alī kwigūlya ya numba alīyo ī shikolo shakwe shilī mu kaya, atizika gīkī ashisole; nū yūyo alī kū malaale nang'hwe atizūshokela shikolo kū numa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wizūkagwi ū nke o ng'wa Lutu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'wene ū wa kwihamba kūlang'hana būpanga bokwe akūbūjimīīja, alīyo ū wa kūbūjimīīja, ū ng'wene akūbūpīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla ū mu būjikū wenūbo, banhū babīlī bakūsangwa balaalile ha būlīīlī būmò, ūmò akūtwalwa ūngī ūlekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakīma babīlī bakūsangwa bakwishiishaga, ūmò akūtwalwa ūngī ūlekwa. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū babīlī bakūbiza balī mu ngūnda, ūmò akūtwalwa ūngī ūlekwa.]” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūmūja gīkī, “Seeba halī?” Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Aho gūlī mimba hū hene aho jikwibilingīla nī mbeshi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
